### 基础同步调用
GET http://localhost:8080/chatclient/basic?message=请介绍 Spring AI

### 带系统消息
GET http://localhost:8080/chatclient/with-system?role=Java专家&message=什么是 ChatClient

### 完整响应、finish reason 和 Usage
GET http://localhost:8080/chatclient/full-response?message=介绍 Spring AI

### 流式文本数据块
GET http://localhost:8080/chatclient/stream?message=讲一个简短的故事
Accept: text/event-stream

### 流式 ChatClientResponse 和 Advisor context
GET http://localhost:8080/chatclient/stream-response?message=讲一个简短的故事
Accept: text/event-stream

### 普通模型：maxTokens
GET http://localhost:8080/chatclient/with-options?message=写一首四行短诗&temperature=1.2&maxTokens=200

### 某些推理模型：maxCompletionTokens（是否支持以当前模型文档为准）
GET http://localhost:8080/chatclient/with-options?message=解释一个复杂问题&maxTokens=300&useMaxCompletionTokens=true

### 参数校验：temperature 超范围，应返回 HTTP 400
GET http://localhost:8080/chatclient/with-options?message=测试&temperature=3&maxTokens=100

### 从现有 ChatClient mutate 派生短回答客户端
GET http://localhost:8080/chatclient/mutated?message=介绍 ChatClient

### 普通结构化输出
GET http://localhost:8080/chatclient/entity

### 供应商原生结构化输出 + Schema 校验
GET http://localhost:8080/chatclient/entity-validated

### 结构化实体和完整 ChatResponse
GET http://localhost:8080/chatclient/response-entity

### 请求 Message Metadata 与供应商响应 Metadata 分开展示
GET http://localhost:8080/chatclient/with-metadata?message=你好

### ChatClientResponse 执行上下文
GET http://localhost:8080/advanced/client-response?message=你好

### 带错误处理的调用
GET http://localhost:8080/advanced/with-error-handling?message=测试消息

### 脱敏自定义日志（需要临时开启 Advisor DEBUG）
GET http://localhost:8080/advanced/with-custom-logger?message=介绍 Spring AI

### 新建或继续多轮对话
POST http://localhost:8080/conversation/conv-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "我想学习 Java"
}

### 继续同一会话
POST http://localhost:8080/conversation/conv-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "从哪里开始？"
}

### 查看对话历史快照
GET http://localhost:8080/conversation/conv-001/history

### 重置对话
DELETE http://localhost:8080/conversation/conv-001

### Message Metadata：基础使用
GET http://localhost:8080/api/metadata/basic?message=介绍一下 Spring AI

### Message Metadata：批量添加
GET http://localhost:8080/api/metadata/batch?message=什么是 ChatClient
X-User-Id: user-123

### Message Metadata：多租户 Advisor
POST http://localhost:8080/api/metadata/multi-tenant?message=解释 Advisor 的作用
X-User-Id: user-456
X-Tenant-Id: tenant-premium

### Message Metadata：优先级 Advisor
POST http://localhost:8080/api/metadata/priority?message=解释 Message Metadata&priority=high
X-User-Id: user-789

### Message Metadata：完整 Advisor context 传播
POST http://localhost:8080/api/metadata/complete?message=总结 Spring AI&priority=high
X-User-Id: complete-user
X-Tenant-Id: tenant-premium

### Message Metadata：本地校验（不调用模型）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/metadata/validation

### 默认 Resource 系统模板与请求参数
GET http://localhost:8080/examples/template?topic=Spring AI&voice=详细

### 自定义分隔符
GET http://localhost:8080/examples/custom-template?topic=JSON

### NoOp 保留字面 JSON
POST http://localhost:8080/examples/literal
Content-Type: text/plain

请解释 {"topic":"Spring AI"}。

### 泛型列表
GET http://localhost:8080/examples/films?actor=汤姆汉克斯

### 聚合流式结果后转换
GET http://localhost:8080/examples/films/stream?actor=汤姆汉克斯

### 请求体参与分析
POST http://localhost:8080/examples/analyze
Content-Type: text/plain

服务很周到，下次还会再来。

### 框架 Memory Advisor
GET http://localhost:8080/examples/memory?conversationId=demo-a&message=我叫小明

### 自动工具循环
GET http://localhost:8080/examples/tools?question=今天的 UTC 日期是什么

### 问答
GET http://localhost:8080/examples/qa?question=什么是 Spring AI

### 代码解释
POST http://localhost:8080/examples/explain-code
Content-Type: text/plain

int result = 1 + 2;

### 摘要与输出上限
POST http://localhost:8080/examples/summarize?maxTokens=100
Content-Type: text/plain

Spring AI 提供统一模型 API，也保留供应商特有选项。

### SSE 数据块
GET http://localhost:8080/examples/typewriter?message=讲一个简短故事
Accept: text/event-stream

### 同步调用统计，不调用模型
GET http://localhost:8080/advanced/metrics

### 博客主示例：POST 请求，读取完整响应
POST http://localhost:8080/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"解释构造器注入为什么方便测试","style":"TECHNICAL","maxTokens":300,"temperature":0.2}

### 相同请求结构，SSE 返回正文与元数据块
POST http://localhost:8080/api/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{"message":"分三点说明依赖注入","style":"CONCISE","maxTokens":300}

